WEBVTT

00:00:05.349 --> 00:00:08.250
The Irresponsible Captain
Tylor

00:00:08.986 --> 00:00:11.855
We may be off the maps...
Chizu ni Nai Tabi Tsuzukeyou

00:00:11.855 --> 00:00:13.914
...but let's stay on this voyage.
Chizu ni Nai Tabi Tsuzukeyou

00:00:14.758 --> 00:00:18.888
I will be holding, never let you go.

00:00:20.464 --> 00:00:23.300
Whatever we may want...
Hoshimono wa Tsukamu no sa

00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:25.427
...we'll take as we need.
Hoshimono wa Tsukamu no sa

00:00:26.203 --> 00:00:30.230
So let's just go wherever we please!
Omoi no Mama Yukou!

00:00:31.942 --> 00:00:34.711
Make me your partner...
Kotoba yori Tashikana Koto

00:00:34.711 --> 00:00:37.339
...on this journey.
Kotoba yori Tashikana Koto

00:00:37.614 --> 00:00:41.209
One that you trust more than words!
Michizure ni Shite

00:00:42.652 --> 00:00:47.316
Come on now and sail away for future!
Imasugu sail away for future

00:00:48.325 --> 00:00:49.826
Things are waiting...
Mishiranu Nanika ga Matteru sa

00:00:49.826 --> 00:00:53.023
...that we've never seen before!
Mishiranu Nanika ga Matteru sa

00:00:54.865 --> 00:00:57.034
Just take your cares...
Kodawari Minna Sutetara

00:00:57.034 --> 00:01:01.095
...and throw them all away.
Kodawari Minna Sutetara

00:01:01.338 --> 00:01:05.968
Come together, just think of tomorrow.

00:01:07.744 --> 00:01:09.234
Let's go!

00:01:12.949 --> 00:01:15.918
HEY HO! THE HAPPY
PENSIONED LIFE!

00:01:19.956 --> 00:01:22.254
I want to thank you
for volunteering.

00:01:22.726 --> 00:01:26.184
For the Raalgon Empire,
we would gladly give our lives!

00:01:26.329 --> 00:01:31.494
I believe you are familiar
already with this UPSF officer.

00:01:33.103 --> 00:01:34.900
Admiral Hanner.

00:01:35.105 --> 00:01:40.310
Yes. His brave and daring
battles on the galactic frontier...

00:01:40.310 --> 00:01:42.676
...have earned him respect
even among we in the Empire.

00:01:42.946 --> 00:01:45.471
I thought he'd retired.

00:01:45.949 --> 00:01:46.574
He has.

00:01:47.350 --> 00:01:49.682
As you can see,
he's living on a pension.

00:01:50.120 --> 00:01:51.246
Good lord...

00:01:51.354 --> 00:01:53.584
To think a former admiral
would be reduced to this!

00:01:53.990 --> 00:01:57.294
The UPSF is desperately trying
to build up its troop strength...

00:01:57.294 --> 00:02:00.491
...in preparation for
the coming war with us.

00:02:00.864 --> 00:02:02.957
But the real question is how
high will their morale be?

00:02:07.971 --> 00:02:10.633
The twilight of a soldier's
life is a sad thing to see.

00:02:11.007 --> 00:02:14.272
I want you to pass this fact on to
the citizens of the United Planets.

00:02:14.344 --> 00:02:15.311
Is that clear?

00:02:22.853 --> 00:02:24.377
Checkmate!
I get your hovertank!

00:02:24.621 --> 00:02:27.852
Whoa! Hold on a sec! There!

00:02:27.958 --> 00:02:28.291
UPSF Benefits Administration
Pension Department

00:02:28.291 --> 00:02:29.960
UPSF Benefits Administration
Pension Department
What's the problem, ya darned
idiot?! I play to win!

00:02:29.960 --> 00:02:32.053
What's the problem, ya darned
idiot?! I play to win!

00:02:32.395 --> 00:02:35.091
I'M ready to play, so why
should I hold off on ya?

00:02:35.165 --> 00:02:36.826
Wow, I really
admire your attitude!

00:02:37.234 --> 00:02:39.836
Bet you were popular with the
ladies when you were young, Chief.

00:02:39.836 --> 00:02:40.996
Oh? How could you tell?

00:02:41.071 --> 00:02:44.666
'Cuz you're a sharp guy, and from
sharp minds comes sharp thinking!

00:02:44.908 --> 00:02:46.843
You always know
exactly what to say.

00:02:46.843 --> 00:02:48.606
That's not something an
ordinary person could fake.

00:02:49.246 --> 00:02:50.280
You really think so?

00:02:50.280 --> 00:02:51.615
So, please, can you lay off on me?

00:02:51.615 --> 00:02:53.810
Oh, sure. Hm?

00:02:55.018 --> 00:02:56.315
Now what?

00:03:00.056 --> 00:03:03.460
Former admiral Robert J. Hanner.
Current address: unknown.

00:03:03.460 --> 00:03:06.657
Pension cannot be delivered.
Confirm new address at once.

00:03:07.063 --> 00:03:10.055
A former admiral? Wow...

00:03:10.400 --> 00:03:13.369
Oh, it can wait till after lunch.

00:03:14.571 --> 00:03:16.334
Hey, Tylor!
Whaddaya wanna do?

00:03:16.473 --> 00:03:18.441
Oh, right. Right, right.

00:03:19.176 --> 00:03:22.873
Let's see...
Former admiral Hanner, huh?

00:03:32.355 --> 00:03:33.754
There you go. Say "ah."

00:03:35.759 --> 00:03:38.057
Well, Father? It isn't
too hot, is it?

00:03:38.128 --> 00:03:41.031
I'm sorry to be such a burden.

00:03:41.031 --> 00:03:42.832
Now, Father, you promised
you wouldn't say that.

00:03:42.832 --> 00:03:46.570
If I'd just died in space...

00:03:46.570 --> 00:03:48.697
...you two could be living
on my survivors pension.

00:03:48.772 --> 00:03:50.637
Please don't worry about that.

00:03:50.774 --> 00:03:53.743
We're just glad you're with us.

00:03:54.077 --> 00:03:57.706
Yumi, Emi, I'm really sorry.

00:03:58.081 --> 00:04:01.642
The change of address was reported,
but it's all tied up in red tape.

00:04:02.152 --> 00:04:05.451
When I get back to HQ, I'll make
sure the pension gets delivered.

00:04:05.655 --> 00:04:06.644
Yuriko...

00:04:07.057 --> 00:04:08.820
You're always
looking out for us.

00:04:09.125 --> 00:04:10.888
I don't mind. We've known
each other since we were little.

00:04:11.261 --> 00:04:15.254
Besides, your father's
done so much for the Force.

00:04:15.665 --> 00:04:18.031
How can the United Planets
government treat him like this?

00:04:24.474 --> 00:04:25.998
Welcome to our home.

00:04:26.476 --> 00:04:27.577
May we ask...

00:04:27.577 --> 00:04:28.601
...who you are?

00:04:32.649 --> 00:04:36.278
"Universal Peace Revolutionary
Front?" What's that?

00:04:41.891 --> 00:04:42.516
Look out!

00:04:56.473 --> 00:04:59.499
Lieutenant Yamamoto. I'm sorry
to interrupt your vacation.

00:05:00.076 --> 00:05:02.340
Please report in at once!

00:05:06.483 --> 00:05:07.381
END

00:05:08.885 --> 00:05:09.817
ALL

00:05:11.554 --> 00:05:12.521
WAR

00:05:16.126 --> 00:05:18.762
Bring Peace and Love to the Universe!
My friends! We, your comrades
in the glorious Universal Peace...

00:05:18.762 --> 00:05:20.497
My friends! We, your comrades
in the glorious Universal Peace...

00:05:20.497 --> 00:05:24.024
...Revolutionary Front,
seek universal love!

00:05:24.334 --> 00:05:29.067
Comrades of the United Planets!
Stop this senseless war!

00:05:29.172 --> 00:05:32.664
You in there! Release the
hostages and come out!

00:05:32.876 --> 00:05:34.444
What are your demands?!

00:05:34.444 --> 00:05:38.107
We have only one demand:
abandon all war!

00:05:38.181 --> 00:05:41.785
Look! They once called
him a space hero!

00:05:41.785 --> 00:05:44.379
But once he got too old,
his army just tossed him aside!

00:05:45.555 --> 00:05:46.817
That's terrible!

00:05:46.956 --> 00:05:50.694
Stop recruiting the general
public into the military...

00:05:50.694 --> 00:05:53.063
...and dissolve the United
Planets Space Force at once!

00:05:53.063 --> 00:05:56.499
Otherwise we cannot guarantee
the safety of the hostages.

00:05:57.167 --> 00:05:57.656
That's!

00:06:01.237 --> 00:06:04.468
Lieutenant Yamamoto! Sorry we
interrupted your vacation, sir.

00:06:06.242 --> 00:06:08.210
That's all right.
How many hostages?

00:06:08.411 --> 00:06:12.142
Four, sir. Admiral Robert J.
Hanner, his two daughters...

00:06:12.215 --> 00:06:15.673
...and Lt. Cmdr. Yuriko Star,
a family friend.

00:06:15.919 --> 00:06:18.154
And what are their demands?

00:06:18.154 --> 00:06:23.592
Well... Dissolution of the
UPSF and renouncement of war.

00:06:23.727 --> 00:06:25.524
Why don't you rush them?

00:06:25.628 --> 00:06:29.530
Because they apparently have
an ultra high-power bomb.

00:06:29.599 --> 00:06:31.396
We have to be
careful with them.

00:06:32.702 --> 00:06:33.794
I see...

00:06:36.940 --> 00:06:40.842
Where is it?
There must be a blind spot.

00:06:42.946 --> 00:06:44.641
Maybe that thing on the roof?

00:06:45.148 --> 00:06:48.845
Lieutenant, message from HQ, sir.

00:06:48.952 --> 00:06:51.216
Right, put it on
the main monitor.

00:06:51.955 --> 00:06:53.445
Who's in charge here?

00:06:54.224 --> 00:06:55.589
Admiral Mifune, sir!

00:06:55.658 --> 00:06:58.889
Do you hear me, friends? The most
important thing in life is love!

00:06:58.962 --> 00:07:00.896
Love is everything!

00:07:01.064 --> 00:07:03.897
Don't be fooled by
mere appearances!

00:07:04.033 --> 00:07:06.636
The universal truth is realizing...

00:07:06.636 --> 00:07:08.238
Hey, what's going on?
...that love exists in your hearts!

00:07:08.238 --> 00:07:08.972
Terrorists have taken hostages...
...that love exists in your hearts!

00:07:08.972 --> 00:07:12.609
Terrorists have taken hostages...
Love! Is anything more beautiful?

00:07:12.609 --> 00:07:15.245
...in a retired admiral's home.
Is it not our duty...

00:07:15.245 --> 00:07:17.338
...to defend it at all costs?

00:07:17.881 --> 00:07:19.109
A retired admiral?

00:07:19.549 --> 00:07:25.422
Is that clear? Handle this sensibly
and rescue those hostages quickly!

00:07:25.422 --> 00:07:27.481
Yes, sir. Understood.

00:07:27.657 --> 00:07:30.990
This is a critical phase in our
preparations to fight the Raalgon.

00:07:31.227 --> 00:07:33.252
You're too soft, Mifune!

00:07:33.329 --> 00:07:34.261
Fuji!

00:07:34.497 --> 00:07:37.557
Do we renounce war
to free the hostages?

00:07:37.767 --> 00:07:39.969
Don't you see that
the moment we do...

00:07:39.969 --> 00:07:42.972
...the United Planets would
become a Raalgon colony?!

00:07:42.972 --> 00:07:46.643
Quiet! Don't you care
about the hostages?!

00:07:46.643 --> 00:07:51.414
It's better to save the hostages
and sacrifice our citizens?!

00:07:51.414 --> 00:07:52.938
I never said that!

00:07:55.018 --> 00:07:58.078
Is that clear, Lieutenant Yamamoto?!
Take care of this!

00:08:03.893 --> 00:08:07.886
Hey, you! Recruit!
Where do you think you're going?!

00:08:08.064 --> 00:08:09.395
Oh, don't worry.

00:08:09.766 --> 00:08:13.536
I'm just going in to give
Admiral Hanner his pension.

00:08:13.536 --> 00:08:16.706
Do you have any idea
what's going on here?!

00:08:16.706 --> 00:08:19.539
Oh, sure. You must have a
really tough job, Lieutenant.

00:08:19.676 --> 00:08:24.636
Grabbing hostages isn't
very fair, is it?

00:08:25.682 --> 00:08:28.117
Sir, the data on the Hanner home.
Our Space Force is much better!

00:08:28.117 --> 00:08:28.284
Our Space Force is much better!

00:08:28.284 --> 00:08:28.751
Right.
Our Space Force is much better!

00:08:28.751 --> 00:08:29.018
Right.

00:08:29.018 --> 00:08:31.646
Sure, we deliver the pension
checks late sometimes...

00:08:31.721 --> 00:08:33.655
...but we always get them there.

00:08:33.723 --> 00:08:36.521
Okay, run a simulation using this.

00:08:36.726 --> 00:08:40.628
In any case, I, Justy Ueki Tylor,
am off to do my duty!

00:08:40.697 --> 00:08:42.324
What? Hey, wait a second!

00:08:43.700 --> 00:08:46.965
Pension?
Is that some sort of code word?

00:08:47.670 --> 00:08:51.197
He must be a secret agent
sent by Admiral Mifune.

00:08:52.375 --> 00:08:55.037
I'm just going in to
deliver the pension!

00:08:57.714 --> 00:09:00.706
Well, now, Mr. Tylor...
Let's see how you handle this.

00:09:01.718 --> 00:09:05.654
What's keeping them?! How long
are they gonna make us wait?!

00:09:05.855 --> 00:09:09.621
Even if you wait forever, they're
not going to dissolve the military!

00:09:09.759 --> 00:09:10.817
What?!

00:09:10.994 --> 00:09:16.125
First of all, we can't do that
just as we're gearing up for a war!

00:09:17.066 --> 00:09:20.467
You guys are Raalgon
agents, aren't you?

00:09:21.037 --> 00:09:22.972
Even if you aren't agents...

00:09:22.972 --> 00:09:26.373
...you must be real second-rate
soldiers to pull a stunt like this!

00:09:27.677 --> 00:09:30.737
Why, you! Who are
you calling second-rate?!

00:09:31.114 --> 00:09:32.103
Calm down!

00:09:32.749 --> 00:09:35.843
How am I supposed to stay
quiet after hearing that?!

00:09:39.789 --> 00:09:40.813
Go! Both of you!

00:09:40.990 --> 00:09:41.791
But, what about...

00:09:41.791 --> 00:09:42.849
...our father?

00:09:43.126 --> 00:09:45.754
He may be old, but he's
still a soldier! Now hurry!

00:09:47.797 --> 00:09:48.786
Yuriko!

00:09:48.898 --> 00:09:49.966
Get going!

00:09:49.966 --> 00:09:50.796
Hold it!

00:09:51.734 --> 00:09:54.396
Is this clear?
Nobody move another step!

00:09:57.106 --> 00:10:03.341
Hi! I'm Recruit Justy Ueki Tylor
of the United Planets Space Force!

00:10:03.446 --> 00:10:04.242
The Space Force!

00:10:05.348 --> 00:10:07.748
You've come to help us?!

00:10:07.817 --> 00:10:12.220
That's right. Recruit Tylor
of the UPSF is at your service.

00:10:24.801 --> 00:10:28.760
I'm here to deliver your
delayed pension check.

00:10:28.871 --> 00:10:30.361
Pension?

00:10:30.974 --> 00:10:32.703
I can see you're sorta busy...

00:10:33.176 --> 00:10:37.078
...but you have to understand that
this is my job. Sorry about this.

00:10:37.513 --> 00:10:38.502
Excuse me, sir.

00:10:42.285 --> 00:10:45.550
Don't be sad, Admiral, sir.

00:10:45.855 --> 00:10:49.347
I'll be glad to come and play
go or shogi with you anytime.

00:10:51.461 --> 00:10:53.952
Well, then, sir,
if you'll excuse me.

00:10:54.631 --> 00:10:55.757
Hold it.

00:10:55.999 --> 00:10:59.025
But, sir. I have other
things on my schedule...

00:11:04.474 --> 00:11:04.940
Oh?

00:11:06.476 --> 00:11:07.101
Oh?

00:11:09.879 --> 00:11:11.039
Oh-ho!

00:11:11.214 --> 00:11:14.274
Your schedule or your life?
Choose now!

00:11:14.550 --> 00:11:16.984
Well, no schedule's
written in stone.

00:11:18.187 --> 00:11:20.485
Hi there. My name's Tylor.

00:11:21.224 --> 00:11:23.784
Looks like you've gotten
yourself caught in a real jam.

00:11:23.893 --> 00:11:26.384
But, now that I'm here,
everything's okay!

00:11:26.763 --> 00:11:28.492
Just relax and leave
everything to me!

00:11:28.564 --> 00:11:30.054
Hold it!
Who do you think...

00:11:30.199 --> 00:11:32.827
Excuse me, shouldn't
I be handcuffed?

00:11:33.536 --> 00:11:35.731
If you don't have any,
I can share hers.

00:11:36.272 --> 00:11:39.833
Oh, you do? Don't feel you
have to. It'd be wasteful.

00:11:40.043 --> 00:11:42.511
Have to watch limited
resources, right?

00:11:42.712 --> 00:11:44.077
What's WITH this guy?

00:11:47.250 --> 00:11:49.946
He's had enough
time to contact us.

00:11:50.253 --> 00:11:52.448
Could he have failed?

00:11:52.588 --> 00:11:55.455
Lieutenant, there's video on
the monitor outside again!

00:11:55.525 --> 00:11:56.514
Right! Put it on!

00:11:56.926 --> 00:11:59.190
Since they've allowed us to
have another hostage...

00:11:59.262 --> 00:12:03.221
...I can only conclude the Space
Force has more men than it needs!

00:12:04.267 --> 00:12:06.531
Oh, not at all!

00:12:06.936 --> 00:12:09.302
They've really been pouring
on the recruitment ads lately.

00:12:09.939 --> 00:12:10.997
What?

00:12:11.274 --> 00:12:14.437
I don't see why everyone
doesn't join the military.

00:12:14.944 --> 00:12:16.878
I mean, there's no easier job!

00:12:18.214 --> 00:12:20.546
Uh, anyway, we'll
wait one more hour!

00:12:20.717 --> 00:12:23.786
If we don't hear a response by
then, we'll kill the hostages!

00:12:23.786 --> 00:12:24.616
Got that?!

00:12:26.289 --> 00:12:29.190
Lieutenant Yamamoto! Who the
hell was that idiot just now?!

00:12:29.325 --> 00:12:33.455
Uh... Wasn't he a special
agent you sent in, sir?

00:12:33.796 --> 00:12:36.697
You fool!
I didn't send that moron!

00:12:37.300 --> 00:12:39.632
What?!
Then, he must really be...

00:12:40.503 --> 00:12:42.405
I'm just going in to
deliver the pension!

00:12:42.405 --> 00:12:43.106
PENSION
I'm just going in to
deliver the pension!

00:12:43.106 --> 00:12:43.765
PENSION

00:12:45.775 --> 00:12:46.867
THAT IDIOT!!!

00:12:49.645 --> 00:12:51.806
What did you
really come here for?

00:12:51.948 --> 00:12:56.282
Huh? I told you. To deliver
Admiral Hanner's pension.

00:12:56.686 --> 00:12:57.653
Why, that's...

00:12:57.653 --> 00:12:58.745
...so kind of you!

00:12:58.988 --> 00:13:01.582
Wow, it really makes
me happy to hear that.

00:13:01.991 --> 00:13:03.754
Now, hold on here!

00:13:03.960 --> 00:13:07.630
But to have met a woman like
you in a place like this...

00:13:07.630 --> 00:13:12.158
...makes me even happier!
What's your name?

00:13:14.570 --> 00:13:17.937
Yuriko. Yuriko Star.
I'm a lieutenant commander.

00:13:18.174 --> 00:13:19.072
Shut up!

00:13:20.009 --> 00:13:22.204
I thought I told you!
No talking!

00:13:23.679 --> 00:13:25.476
Pick on somebody
your own size!

00:13:32.955 --> 00:13:35.253
A terrorist dedicated
to his revolution...

00:13:35.324 --> 00:13:37.554
...shouldn't act
like a salaryman.

00:13:37.627 --> 00:13:39.254
Yes, you're right.

00:13:47.670 --> 00:13:50.002
Yumi, sorry about this...

00:14:10.660 --> 00:14:12.150
Here, you dropped this.

00:14:12.395 --> 00:14:14.226
Oh, thank you kindly.

00:14:16.265 --> 00:14:18.927
Why did you give
him the gun back?!

00:14:19.101 --> 00:14:22.593
Huh? But you're supposed to
return things when people drop them.

00:14:22.772 --> 00:14:25.002
Not in this situation!

00:14:25.308 --> 00:14:28.402
Be quiet. How many times
are you going to resist us?

00:14:29.078 --> 00:14:31.342
You're only going to
get yourselves killed.

00:14:31.914 --> 00:14:33.575
Wow! He's gorgeous!

00:14:33.649 --> 00:14:35.583
That is one handsome guy!

00:14:36.085 --> 00:14:38.485
The only place we can get
in is through this vent.

00:14:39.088 --> 00:14:42.580
Organize a raiding party.
We'll use gas shells.

00:14:42.692 --> 00:14:44.489
You're being too easy on
them, Lieutenant Yamamoto!

00:14:45.094 --> 00:14:48.530
Do you want the United Planets
to become a Raalgon colony?!

00:14:48.631 --> 00:14:51.691
We can't let the civilians get
caught in the middle of this!

00:14:51.901 --> 00:14:56.072
Who cares? One shot from a
missile will make 'em surrender!

00:14:56.072 --> 00:14:57.664
Do you want to kill
the hostages with them?

00:14:57.740 --> 00:15:00.368
Do you want to sacrifice all
mankind for five people?!

00:15:00.776 --> 00:15:01.510
But...

00:15:01.510 --> 00:15:04.013
It doesn't matter! Attack!
Show 'em we mean business!

00:15:04.013 --> 00:15:05.173
No! No!

00:15:05.448 --> 00:15:08.110
Should I or shouldn't I?!

00:15:11.621 --> 00:15:12.986
You're wonderful!

00:15:13.122 --> 00:15:14.646
So elegant!

00:15:15.124 --> 00:15:17.490
A warrior must not be
concerned with his looks.

00:15:17.793 --> 00:15:19.658
That is the essence
of manliness.

00:15:20.129 --> 00:15:22.689
Oh, no! Looks are
part of being a man!

00:15:22.899 --> 00:15:27.598
And, with yours, I'm surprised
you aren't a model or a movie star.

00:15:27.803 --> 00:15:30.567
Come on! Looking at you,
I'd bet you spend an hour...

00:15:30.640 --> 00:15:33.404
...in front of the
mirror every morning.

00:15:33.643 --> 00:15:34.410
Certainly not.

00:15:34.410 --> 00:15:38.107
Really? I wouldn't think
you'd look so good otherwise.

00:15:38.781 --> 00:15:40.305
What use would
I have for a mirror?

00:15:41.117 --> 00:15:43.051
Don't let him trick you!

00:15:44.654 --> 00:15:46.884
Now, now.
Just hold on there.

00:15:47.790 --> 00:15:51.590
If you have to be killed, wouldn't
you prefer the handsome one to do it?

00:15:51.727 --> 00:15:53.092
That's right!

00:15:53.729 --> 00:15:56.027
I want this one
to kill me, too!

00:15:56.832 --> 00:15:58.094
Oh, dear...

00:15:58.367 --> 00:16:01.495
We can forgive anything a
beautiful person might do.

00:16:01.704 --> 00:16:05.374
If we could be strangled by
your long, graceful fingers...

00:16:05.374 --> 00:16:06.705
...we would die happily.

00:16:07.176 --> 00:16:08.609
All right, fine!

00:16:08.678 --> 00:16:10.771
If you wanna die so badly,
I'll oblige you!

00:16:11.213 --> 00:16:12.111
Be quiet!

00:16:12.181 --> 00:16:14.149
If you're naughty,
you won't get fed!

00:16:14.216 --> 00:16:15.911
Huh?! "Get fed?"

00:16:15.985 --> 00:16:19.751
Who do you think you are?!
A man's looks are everything!

00:16:19.922 --> 00:16:22.091
Do you think you
have any looks?!

00:16:22.091 --> 00:16:24.787
Ugly men don't
exist in this world!

00:16:24.927 --> 00:16:29.523
Even if they do, they're not
real men! They're less than human!

00:16:29.632 --> 00:16:33.033
Girls, please!
You shouldn't be so hard on him.

00:16:33.235 --> 00:16:36.329
At least explain how
he's bow-legged and short...

00:16:36.539 --> 00:16:39.440
...and all the other details
that make him so ugly.

00:16:39.542 --> 00:16:40.531
But...

00:16:40.843 --> 00:16:43.141
A man's face is most important.

00:16:43.346 --> 00:16:44.176
Right?

00:16:47.283 --> 00:16:51.083
The United Planets must not
become a Raalgon colony!

00:16:52.555 --> 00:16:54.750
This is for the best...

00:16:57.827 --> 00:16:59.454
I knew it'd look good!

00:16:59.562 --> 00:17:00.688
I see...

00:17:00.763 --> 00:17:03.994
The more you polish yourself,
the more manly you look!

00:17:04.233 --> 00:17:07.100
I now truly appreciate
the effect of cosmetics.

00:17:08.504 --> 00:17:10.706
Don't be fooled!
A man isn't his face!

00:17:10.706 --> 00:17:13.334
A man's his heart! His guts!
His soul! His passions!

00:17:16.212 --> 00:17:20.842
Enemy missile lock detected.
Take shelter at once!

00:17:20.916 --> 00:17:23.510
What?!
But we're still in here!

00:17:23.586 --> 00:17:26.680
Target locked in.
Three minutes to launch.

00:17:26.756 --> 00:17:29.091
Well, looks like
they've abandoned you.

00:17:29.091 --> 00:17:30.456
Looks like they have.

00:17:30.593 --> 00:17:33.687
Listen, if you don't do
something, we'll all be killed!

00:17:33.796 --> 00:17:35.525
Or do you want to die here?!

00:17:35.598 --> 00:17:39.557
She's right. Everyone has a right
to live, no matter how they look.

00:17:40.736 --> 00:17:42.829
You little! Are you
still talking nonsense?!

00:17:42.905 --> 00:17:46.534
A man's his heart! His guts!
His soul! His passions!

00:17:46.776 --> 00:17:47.470
Right?

00:17:48.277 --> 00:17:50.546
It's too late to
try flattering me!

00:17:50.546 --> 00:17:53.572
Oh, no! I mean it!

00:17:54.150 --> 00:17:55.985
Come on,
a man without feelings...

00:17:55.985 --> 00:18:00.479
...couldn't have made
that speech before.

00:18:01.624 --> 00:18:04.559
A person must have a
pure heart above all else.

00:18:04.727 --> 00:18:07.821
A pure heart.
That's human love.

00:18:07.963 --> 00:18:11.899
But nobody really
understands your pure heart.

00:18:12.034 --> 00:18:14.229
They're too distracted
by your looks.

00:18:14.303 --> 00:18:18.763
They don't see the real you hidden
deep behind that horrible face.

00:18:19.308 --> 00:18:22.845
You're right!
Nobody understands me!

00:18:22.845 --> 00:18:25.245
We don't have time for this!

00:18:25.481 --> 00:18:27.073
If we don't get out
of here, we're all...

00:18:27.316 --> 00:18:29.216
No, that won't be necessary.

00:18:35.925 --> 00:18:37.756
Are you crying?

00:18:37.927 --> 00:18:40.794
He really does
have a pure heart.

00:18:41.664 --> 00:18:43.564
I'm not sad!

00:18:43.632 --> 00:18:46.465
I'm moved to tears!
Man's tears!

00:18:46.735 --> 00:18:49.898
Today, for the first
time in my life...

00:18:49.972 --> 00:18:52.770
...I've met someone who
truly understands me!

00:18:53.275 --> 00:18:56.039
So, you're going to put down
the bomb and let us go?

00:18:56.946 --> 00:19:01.042
No. I'll never be
moved like this again!

00:19:01.317 --> 00:19:04.286
I'll never receive such
understanding from another man!

00:19:04.353 --> 00:19:06.480
So, please!
Let's all die together!

00:19:07.356 --> 00:19:09.847
Please! Die with me!

00:19:09.992 --> 00:19:13.484
We, the abandoned,
will all die by this bomb!

00:19:14.263 --> 00:19:16.458
Well, if you say so, but...

00:19:16.732 --> 00:19:18.723
I think I blew it, Yuriko.

00:19:20.970 --> 00:19:23.063
Don't talk to me
like we're friends!

00:19:23.372 --> 00:19:28.810
Everything went from bad to
worse when you showed up!

00:19:28.878 --> 00:19:31.574
"Just relax and leave
everything to me," huh?!

00:19:31.981 --> 00:19:36.145
There's still...
There's still so much I want to do!

00:19:36.719 --> 00:19:39.051
Why do I have to
die like this?!

00:19:39.388 --> 00:19:41.379
Give me back my youth!

00:19:42.491 --> 00:19:44.960
Well, I can't give
you back your youth...

00:19:44.960 --> 00:19:48.452
...but I can let you hit me.
Here, use this.

00:19:51.534 --> 00:19:54.560
Are you sure? I can hit you?

00:19:55.004 --> 00:19:56.631
Go on. I don't mind.

00:19:57.106 --> 00:19:59.336
I'll hit you really hard.

00:19:59.408 --> 00:20:00.534
I don't mind.

00:20:00.743 --> 00:20:03.075
Right!
Fifteen seconds to launch!

00:20:03.412 --> 00:20:04.811
Here it comes!

00:20:18.561 --> 00:20:22.398
Damn it all! Can't I
even be allowed to die?!

00:20:22.398 --> 00:20:24.195
You shouldn't want to!

00:20:25.267 --> 00:20:27.997
If you live, good things
may happen to you.

00:20:28.070 --> 00:20:30.903
You could even become
a movie star one day.

00:20:31.240 --> 00:20:34.038
Think how boring the world would
be if everyone was handsome.

00:20:34.443 --> 00:20:37.708
Maybe women'll even like
your kind of face someday.

00:20:38.280 --> 00:20:43.217
Better to have that than a pretty
face and an ugly heart, right?

00:20:49.491 --> 00:20:50.583
Oh, my...

00:20:53.729 --> 00:20:56.163
Somebody, give me
a status report!

00:21:06.809 --> 00:21:11.109
So, their last message
simply said "Justy Ueki Tylor"?

00:21:11.247 --> 00:21:11.770
Yes, sir.

00:21:12.715 --> 00:21:17.084
Tylor, eh? It might be worthwhile
to learn more about him.

00:21:23.826 --> 00:21:25.623
What just happened?

00:21:25.828 --> 00:21:28.592
Lieutenant, sir!
Are you okay?

00:21:29.498 --> 00:21:31.625
We're all set up here!

00:21:32.134 --> 00:21:33.897
Good work, sir!

00:21:35.004 --> 00:21:38.667
Didn't something just fall on me?

00:21:39.074 --> 00:21:41.770
Don't worry!
The hostages are all fine!

00:21:41.877 --> 00:21:45.438
Tylor. You said you were
Recruit Justy Ueki Tylor, right?

00:21:45.614 --> 00:21:46.273
Yeah.

00:21:46.682 --> 00:21:52.120
I won't ask for my youth back,
but I can still hit you, can't I?

00:21:52.321 --> 00:21:53.811
Huh? What for?

00:22:02.464 --> 00:22:04.432
Who is that man?

00:22:12.741 --> 00:22:13.730
The Irresponsible Captain Tylor
Next Episode

00:22:15.344 --> 00:22:17.710
The Captain...
He is a father to his crew.

00:22:17.780 --> 00:22:19.714
The Captain...
He is the king of his ship.

00:22:19.915 --> 00:22:23.078
The Captain...
That's Tylor's new title.

00:22:23.218 --> 00:22:25.516
Next time, "The Ship Sets Sail,
but Misgivings Remain."

